# devcast — Environment Variables
# Copy this file to .env for local development
# In GitHub Actions, add these as Repository Secrets (Settings → Secrets → Actions)
# NEVER commit .env to the repository

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# GITHUB
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# Automatically provided in GitHub Actions — no action needed
# For local development: create a PAT at github.com → Settings → Developer settings → PATs
# Scopes needed: repo (read), write:discussion (create issues)
GITHUB_TOKEN=

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# ANTHROPIC CLAUDE API
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# Get your key at: console.anthropic.com → API Keys → Create key
# This is the ONLY paid service. Estimated cost: ~$0.006 per post generated.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# BUFFER
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# How to get your Buffer access token:
#   1. Go to: buffer.com/developers/apps
#   2. Create a new app (name: "devcast", callback URL: http://localhost)
#   3. Note your Client ID and Client Secret
#   4. Authorize the app for your account to exchange for an access token
#   5. Copy the access token below
#   Token is long-lived (months). If it expires, you'll see 401 errors — regenerate here.
BUFFER_ACCESS_TOKEN=

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# SUPABASE (voice history database)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# How to get these:
#   1. Create a free project at supabase.com
#   2. Go to Settings → API
#   3. Copy "Project URL" and "service_role" key (NOT the anon key)
#   4. Run database/schema.sql in the Supabase SQL Editor (one time)
#
# IMPORTANT: Use the service_role key (not anon key).
# The schema enables Row Level Security — the anon key has zero access by design.
# The service_role key bypasses RLS and is safe for server-side use (Actions only).
# NEVER expose this key in client-side / browser code.
SUPABASE_URL=
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# LOCAL DEVELOPMENT OVERRIDES
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# For local development, use SQLite instead of Supabase (no key needed)
# USE_SQLITE=true
# SQLITE_PATH=./data/devcast.db
